# Cyrius — Tooling & Formats
# Compiler binaries, CLI driver, dev tools, helper scripts,
# format files, env vars, flags, plugin/LSP wiring.
# Sizes refreshed 2026-10-06 at the 6.6.20 closeout, from the 6.6.19 slot
# (cycc 1,586,184 B; check.sh 192 / 192 shell gates + 2 named SKIPs;
# self_compile 923 ms; crosses cycc_aarch64 1,114,920 B / cycc_win
