# 6.6.11 (2026-09-29) — CONTENT additions, not a size refresh (cycc 6.6.11 was
# 1,437,168 B): `cyrius
# test`/`tests` (`tests` removed at 6.7.12) grade the assert summary (tcyr_test_format; `test <dir>` is refused —
